{
  "id": "ru-e39938a189b5.en",
  "jokeId": "ru-e39938a189b5",
  "locale": "en",
  "title": "The Firefighters",
  "kind": "joke",
  "v": 2,
  "location": "bolnitsa",
  "place": "hospital",
  "cast": [
    "sluzhivy",
    "sluzhivy-ryadovoy",
    "doktor"
  ],
  "roles": {
    "sluzhivy": "firefighter",
    "sluzhivy-ryadovoy": "firefighter",
    "doktor": "doctor"
  },
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "l1",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "Dedicated to our valiant Fire Brigade...",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "The firefighters were called out to put out a fire at the hospital.",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l3",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "Well, they did everything the way real heroes should:",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l4",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "They put out the fire and didn't fall flat on their faces.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l5",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "When the job is done, the crew commander reports to the head doctor:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l6",
      "character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy",
      "text": "Mission accomplished, the fire has been put out.",
      "emotion": "smug",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l7",
      "character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy",
      "text": "Although... there are casualties. Nine people.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l8",
      "character": "sluzhivy-ryadovoy",
      "text": "We revived seven, but unfortunately we couldn't save the other two.",
      "emotion": "sad",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l9",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "At these words the head doctor faints.",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l10",
      "character": "narrator",
      "text": "When he comes to, stammering and barely able to get the words out, he says:",
      "emotion": "neutral",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "l11",
      "character": "doktor",
      "text": "What do you mean, seven??? Guys, that was the morgue you were putting out...",
      "emotion": "surprised",
      "pauseAfterSec": 0.8,
      "laugh": "big"
    }
  ],
